            <div type="translation" resp="part:emfr">
                
                <p n="1">
                    Prosperity!
                </p>
                
                <p n="2-4">
                    Sixth year of Nirupatoṅkappōttaraiyar.<note>Sanskrit Nṛpatuṅga + Tamil Pōttaraiyar. That is, the Pallava king Nṛpatuṅga.</note>
                </p>
                
                <p n="3-6">
                    The sluice that ... had made.    			   			
                </p>   	
                
